{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"35":"Combing the Hair (Kitab Al-Tarajjul)"},"section_detail":{"35":{"hadithnumber_first":4159,"hadithnumber_last":4213,"arabicnumber_first":4159,"arabicnumber_last":4213,"name_native":"كتاب الترجّل"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4184,"arabicnumber":4184,"text":"حدثنا حفص بن عمر، حدثنا شعبة، عن ابي اسحاق، عن البراء، قال كان رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم له شعر يبلغ شحمة اذنيه","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":35,"hadith":26}}]}